<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@/~cl_3__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@/~cl_3__para_c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@/~cl_3__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (4), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “subseksyen (2)” perkataan “, (2a)”. Bahagian baru IVa"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/22/msa@> .
